OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA band of
OL,6,Fincreasingly patchy rain will clear
OL,7,Feastwards from England and Wales,
OL,8,Fleaving clear spells for many. Some
OL,9,Fshowers will persist, mainly in the
OL,10,Fnorthwest, where it will remain
OL,11,Fbreezy. Locally chilly in the north,
OL,12,Fwhile staying mild elsewhere.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FSome showers, mainly in the
OL,15,Fmorning across some northern and
OL,16,Fwestern areas. Otherwise Friday looks
OL,17,Ffine with sunny spells. Feeling
OL,18,Fpleasantly warm in the south, but
OL,19,Fremaining breezy further north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
